@bank dept:works
// Pillar 5 Step 3 (head writer W2): team jobs (seat M2), the lead's calls when whoever leads has no line of their own
// (Halloran, Torres and Calder have theirs). Kind 'work', flags team.call.<part>. Bubbles, 60 characters or fewer.
== work
? flag:team.call.start
- Spots, everyone. Wait for your name.
? flag:team.call.brace
- {me}, brace it. Hold there.
? flag:team.call.pass
- {me}, pass it across.
? flag:team.call.hold
- {me}, hold it steady.
? flag:team.call.crank
- {me}, crank. Nice and slow.
? flag:team.call.tip
- {me}, tip it and hold.
? flag:team.call.valves
- {me}, the valves. In order.
? flag:team.call.open
- {me}, open them up.
? flag:team.call.drain
- {me}, drain it down.
? flag:team.call.done
- That's it. Good work, everyone.
